        editorPosition: {x: 1659.2001, y: -5.600006}
        speakerId: Glow (softly)
        text: "Sometimes, everything becomes heavy because of stress, fear, or loneliness...
          That\u2019s when the World-Tree loses its light. But that doesn\u2019t
          mean it\u2019s gone forever. It\u2019s just diminished, and the colors
          faded with it."
